### 1. Create Homework Assignment
POST {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": "{{classId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "title": "Algebra Practice Exercise",
  "description": "Complete questions 1 to 10 on page 45.",
  "dueDate": "2026-03-20T17:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Get Homework Assignments by Class
GET {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments/class/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 3. Get Homework Assignments by Teacher
GET {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments/teacher/{{teacherId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 4. Get Homework Assignment by ID
GET {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 5. Update Homework Assignment
PATCH {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Algebra Practice Exercise",
  "description": "Complete questions 1 to 15 on page 45 and 46."
}

### 6. Submit or Update Student Homework (Upsert)
POST {{homeworkUrl}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": "{{assignmentId}}",
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "submissionText": "Completed and uploaded via student portal PDF.",
  "status": "Submitted",
  "submittedAt": "2026-03-18T14:30:00Z"
}

### 7. Get Homework Submission by ID
GET {{homeworkUrl}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 8. Get All Student Homework Submissions
GET {{homeworkUrl}}/submissions/student/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 9. Grade Student Homework Submission
PATCH {{homeworkUrl}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gradeScore": 95.5
}

### 10. Delete Homework Assignment
DELETE {{homeworkUrl}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 11. Delete Homework Submission
DELETE {{homeworkUrl}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}